self.KB_CONTENT["card:753193"]={"id":"card:753193","ty":"card","sourceId":"753193","title":"『客戶訂單F/O明細表』中的『選擇確認狀態 (COP.TC027)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"明細表","keywords":["明細表","客戶","訂單","狀態"],"y":"other","answer":"* 計有四種選擇Y.已確認(『核』)、N.未確認(『』)、V.作廢(『廢』)及全部(不須篩選)。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
